 "A tour company's booking agent in Cape Town needs visa support letters for twelve travellers. Another firm runs an agent that does exactly that. MCP is for tools; A2A is for handing a job to another agent.": "07fc6ff65b.mp3",
 "The document agent publishes a card: its skills, what it accepts, how to talk to it, and a signature. The booking agent checks the signature before trusting it.": "126d6d8138.mp3",
 "A look-alike domain serves a card with no valid signature. Trust it, and twelve passports go to a stranger.": "a71bc72152.mp3",
 "The booking agent sends a message with text, traveller data and passport scans. The task moves from submitted to working, then pauses: one scan is unreadable.": "78c808d36c.mp3",
 "Input required is a question, not a failure. Give up instead, and the letters never come.": "20cd4e401f.mp3",
 "The letters stream back in chunks. Only the one marked last completes the file. And all along, the other firm's workings stay its own.": "3a45f195ff.mp3"
